<title>POLAND: WEDEL APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 5.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>WEDEL APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 5.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.26 vs   3.27</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.65 vs   1.75</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.17 vs   1.34</p>
<p> Sales		   59.91 vs  44.35</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    14.09 vs   6.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	20.11 vs   8.44</p>
<p> Operating profit    18.37 vs   6.39</p>
<p> Sales		  235.99 vs 196.35</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectioner is Zaklady</p>
<p>Przemyslu Cukierniczego Wedel SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
